{"reply":"You could put it this way:

> “Part of me wants to own up immediately because honesty matters to me. Another part wants to repair things quietly, before anyone can think less of me. Tonight, those impulses feel less like two choices and more like two versions of me competing for the right response.”

Or, more simply: “I’m torn between being honest out loud and protecting how I’m seen by fixing things in private.”","memory":{"kind":"no_memory_candidate","reason_code":"automatic_capture_disabled"}}

